# Stab Sheet Report Generator - Environment Variables

# NOTE: The current version of this application does not require any environment
# variables. All processing happens client-side in the browser.

# This file is provided as a placeholder for future features that may require
# environment variables, such as:
# - Server-side API keys for external services
# - Database connection strings (if server-side persistence is added)
# - Analytics or monitoring service keys
# - Feature flags

# Example (for future reference):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_KEY=your_analytics_key_here
# DATABASE_URL=your_database_url_here

# For Vercel deployment, environment variables can be configured in the
# Vercel Dashboard under Project Settings > Environment Variables.
